A||||2||DJRice||Pics of My Car with a bit of history||||1||
Z||000000||DJRice||08-21-2000||08:30 PM||||Well, I washed my car the other day and she look so good that I took my camera with me to work the next day and on the way home and took a few pics next to a memorial not open to the general public on Cape Canaveral Air Force Station.<P>These were taken outside the entrance to Space Launch Complex 14, CCAFS, FL.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Slc14b.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Slc14a.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Slc14c.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Slc14d.jpg">  <P>The original flight plans for the first manned orbital flights are sealed in a time capsule under the plate shown in the last pic.  It is not to be opened until 2464.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/slc34a.jpg"> <P>The Memorial at SLC-34, were the Apollo 1 disaster took place.  The things in the background are what was used to deflect the blast of the rocket engines.  <P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>"You mean like the back seat of a Volkswagen?"<p>[This message has been edited by DJRice (edited 08-21-2000).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||fropuff||08-21-2000||08:37 PM||||Hey!  You stole DXR's Fiero!  Give it back!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Actually, it looks really nice.  I don't know why black can look so good.  ||||reg||10
Z||000002||DXR_DAD||08-21-2000||09:19 PM||||You know what I have to say  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>YA    !!!!!! BLACK NOTCHBACK!!!!!!!<BR>Don't it look SWEEEEEEEEET??<P>Dillon it looks good!!! Keep up the wash & wax <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P><BR>DXR_DAD||||reg||14
